<title>SWEDEN: SAS, LUFTHANSA MERGE SOME SALES OPERATIONS.</title>
<headline>SAS, LUFTHANSA MERGE SOME SALES OPERATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scandinavian airline SAS and Germany's Lufthansa said on Thursday they are strengthening cooperation by forming a joint sales operation in Sweden and Norway.</p>
<p>Under the agreement SAS will take over all Lufthansa sales activities in the two countries and negotiations were underway for a similar deal in Denmark</p>
